---
import D2Diagram from "./D2Diagram.astro";
---

<D2Diagram
  title="From human intent to evidence"
  description="The human operator sets intent and authority; software agents do bounded work; qualification reviews the exact state; production proves the deployed behavior; real use returns evidence to the operator."
  desktop="/images/diagrams/factory-flow.svg"
  mobile="/images/diagrams/factory-flow-mobile.svg"
  caption="Tests, release and real-world use are different observations. The loop only closes when evidence returns to the operator."
  className="factory-plate"
>
  <ol class="diagram-transcript">
    <li>
      <strong>Human operator</strong>
      <span>Sets intent, boundaries and ownership.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Software agents</strong>
      <span>Complete bounded work that stays reviewable.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Qualification</strong>
      <span>Checks the exact candidate and records what passed.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Production</strong>
      <span>Deploys a named state and observes live behavior.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Real use</strong>
      <span>People, devices and environments add evidence that software checks cannot supply.</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
</D2Diagram>
